WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:04.800
Three companies. One score each.

2
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:09.500
The gate asked which one. For a market, all of them.

3
00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:13.400
One word is a name. Two is a description.

4
00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:17.300
And every company carries why it is here.

5
00:00:17.300 --> 00:00:21.400
Four ways to be left out, all of them named.

6
00:00:21.400 --> 00:00:25.200
Two of them look identical from outside.

7
00:00:25.200 --> 00:00:29.800
The stop list could not grow, and that is the rule.

8
00:00:29.800 --> 00:00:34.100
A note names only the companies actually read.

9
00:00:34.100 --> 00:00:36.400
One idea, several companies.
